libgcroots
------------------------------------------
This library abstracts architecture-dependent part of garbage collector roots
acquisition such as register windows of SPARC and register stack backing store
of IA-64. Main part of the code is based on Boehm GC 7.0.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.11-1
  libgcroots-devel-0.3.6-1bl1
  libgcroots0-0.3.6-1bl1
  pkg-config-3.0.9-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20260320-2
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.10-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/uim/libgcroots

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/uim/libgcroots/archive/refs/tags/0.3.6.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libgcroots-0.3.6-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libgcroots-0.3.6-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libgcroots-0.3.6-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libgcroots-0.3.6-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libgcroots0-0.3.6-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libgcroots-devel-0.3.6-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libgcroots)
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libgcroots.README
  /usr/share/doc/libgcroots/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/libgcroots/README
  /usr/share/doc/libgcroots/news.md

(libgcroots0)
  /usr/bin/cyggcroots-0.dll

(libgcroots-devel)
  /usr/include/gcroots.h
  /usr/lib/libgcroots.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/gcroots.pc

